  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Southern Border’s righteous path pairs him with Tie Qu Zhong to hunt Fang Yuan. In treasure yellow heaven he negotiates Shang clan help for Tie Qu Zhong’s white steel extract resource point, praises the plan, and steers trade toward Shang clan’s own dragonfish stall against Fang Yuan’s sales. When the hunt closes he laughs that Lu Wei Yin found the demon at last.",
      "chapters": [
        1600
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_southern_border",
        "char_tie_qu_zhong",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "fac_shang_clan",
        "char_lu_wei_yin"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan steals Tie Qu Zhong’s edge Gu, Shang Hu Zhang and the rest force past year beasts to reinforce him. After Immortal Gu are stolen he sweats from shock and warns that some year beasts are enslaved and dangerous.",
      "chapters": [
        1603
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ambush-reinforcement",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_edge_immortal_gu",
        "gu_after_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Jun Shen Guang states that Shang clan’s Shang Hu Zhang cultivates transformation path and wood path, with methods that keep the two paths from conflicting, much like Thunder Ghost True Monarch. His methods are complex and comprehensive, and he is a peak rank seven expert of Shang clan.",
      "chapters": [
        1604
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dual-path-peak-expert",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_jun_shen_guang",
        "char_thunder_ghost_true_monarch"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He is named among the Southern Border rank seven experts firmly locked in Fang Yuan’s sovereign immortal aperture after the dream realm ambush.",
      "chapters": [
        1605
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "captive",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
